{"id":"fd631ecda873f6cf","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-cofinality-ideal.md","title":"Cofinality of Ideal","display":"df-cofinality-ideal — Cofinality of Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cofinality-ideal","aliases":["58-df-cofinality-ideal"],"display":"df-cofinality-ideal — Cofinality of Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cofinality-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cofinality-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cofinality-ideal — Cofinality of Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,I,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(X,I,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalityIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalityIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\">\\(\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅在唯一见证存在时取值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CofinalityIdeal}_S(\\kappa,I,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\kappa=\n\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\land\n\\forall B\\in I\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CofinalityIdeal}_S(\\kappa,I,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\kappa=\n\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\land\n\\forall B\\in I\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cof}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{cof}(I)\\)</span>: the least size of a subset cofinal in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,\\subseteq)\">\\((I,\\subseteq)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The covering number is different: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cov}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{cov}(I)\\)</span> uses a family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\)</span> whose union is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>. The former formula incorrectly used sets outside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> and therefore defined neither invariant.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,I,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalityIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CofinalityIdeal}_S(\\kappa,I,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\kappa=\n\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\land\n\\forall B\\in I\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cof}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"(I,\\subseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cov}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1365,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality-ideal]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-306","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-cofinality-ideal.md|58-df-cofinality-ideal]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}